  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  _data:
    IsOpen: 0
    Description: 1. "Reconnaissance fire" - using an arrow of darkness every second
      the enemy is found. Targets within range are affected by the "worry" debuff,
      a magical effect that lasts 5 seconds, reduces the speed of casting a spell
      and increases mana consumption by 10%, totaling 3 times. 2. Scout fire is greater
      by 1 square and further by 4 seconds. 3. Every individualThe Mark of the Huntress
      damage gives you a 10% chance to apply the Calm buff.
    Icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 00ece4a041f500e40b7ddbbf71ee4594, type: 3}
