  _data:
    IsOpen: 0
    Description: "1. Astral \u2013 Terrafine sends itself or any target into the
      astral, while in the astral, the movement speed decreases by 50%, the magical
      damage received increases by 10%. 2. Each stream of celestial arrows through
      the astral restores 3% of the total mana supply."
